# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for sanctioned, documented races only.
# Wire with: TSAN_OPTIONS=...:suppressions=$PWD/test/tsan.supp
#
# Thunk.targetLeadingRacy is an advisory speculation peek: a tear-free
# monotonic word load of a thunk's payload that may race the claimer's plain
# `resolve` store by design. Staleness is bound-guarded at every caller, and
# the store side cannot become atomic without splitting the safety-checked
# union write or growing the size-critical thunk. See the doc comment on
# `Thunk.targetLeadingRacy` (src/runtime/thunk.zig) before adding ANYTHING
# to this file: every other race report is a real bug.
race:*targetLeadingRacy*
